<title>USA: Data Systems Network opens four offices.</title>
<headline>Data Systems Network opens four offices.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Systems Network Corp said it opened new sales offices in four cities the company believes will produce sales fairly soon.</p>
<p>Data Systems Network said new sales groups are in operation in Columbus, Ohio; Jackson, Mississippi; Columbia, South Carolina; and Atlanta, Georgia. The company said staffing decisions will be based on market conditions and the level of business opportunities.</p>
<p>Data Systems Network provides network integration services.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading off 5/8 at 9-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
